1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
2052 - GREENLAND

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:27,000
SYSTEM FAILURE / VIRUS DETECTED

3
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
PROJECT HORIZON
ADVENTURE AT THE HEART OF DIGITAL

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Technician: Okay, we're rolling, you can go.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Swann: Welcome to the Data Palace!
Swann and Ismail here.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
We are in charge of this data center,

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
designed to store resource data
important to scientists worldwide.

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Ismail: If you're seeing this message,

9
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
it's because we need your help.

10
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,000
There was a major cyberattack a few hours ago,

11
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,000
and it has disrupted many of the
data center's systems.

12
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Swann: We are going to leave

13
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,000
to fix the center's network manager systems,

14
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:02,000
but we need all the skills and intelligence

15
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,000
of IT specialists like you
to fix all the other systems.

16
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Swann: By the way Hal,
can you give us the list of problems?

17
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,000
HAL: According to the diagnostic system,

18
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,000
several servers are close to overheating.

19
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,000
They must be cooled down urgently.

20
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
HAL: A blockage has been detected
in ventilation duct 25B.

21
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,500
It must be removed as quickly as possible

22
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:21,000
to reactivate the cooling systems.

23
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Ismail: As you can see, there is a lot to do.

24
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Don't hesitate to refer to
the envelope you were given.

25
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,500
And if you need help,

26
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:31,000
ask one of the technicians accompanying you.

27
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Swann: Work together
to overcome the challenges ahead!

28
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Don't hesitate to stick together.

29
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Ismail: Thank you for your help
and good luck to everyone!